{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Pandemonium: Merge!",
    "steam_appid": 3624430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available in English, Portugu\u00eas, Fran\u00e7ais, Italiano, Deutsch, Espa\u00f1ol, \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4, \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e, \u534e\u8bed, \u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439 \u044f\u0437\u044b\u043a</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A <strong><i>HOT</i></strong>\u00a0New Take On Merge Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the casual, yet frustratingly fun experience of 'suika-likes' but want to taste something new? Whether it's a challenge or a casual cozy vibe you're looking for,\u00a0This silly  frying pan game has all the physics-based, merge goodness you'll love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624430/extras/b23473553efb9d2f6eacfe889ed3f5b8.poster.avif?t=1746724425\" width=480 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624430/extras/b23473553efb9d2f6eacfe889ed3f5b8.webm?t=1746724425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything and more! Hungry yet?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge bigger and bigger foods, chain sizzling combos for\u00a0a\u00a0higher score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace! Easy to pick up, difficult to beat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes if you want to turn up the heat or if you just want to keep it casual!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cosmetics via the Steam Market/Inventory</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match, Merge and Make Mayhem in a Pan!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss ingredients into your pan - flip, smoosh and bounce them to merge bigger and bigger surprises! Cook up even higher scores by merging bigger ingredients and chaining sizzling combos!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From cozy to challenging, Play it your way!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever you're tired of the classic 'suika-game' experience and chilling with your critters, Crank up the difficulty with different game modes and modifiers that are guaranteed to sizzle up a new challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More information to come! Please stay tuned as I update the Steam page and Demo :)</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i> </i></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available in English, Portugu\u00eas, Fran\u00e7ais, Italiano, Deutsch, Espa\u00f1ol, \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4, \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e, \u534e\u8bed, \u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439 \u044f\u0437\u044b\u043a</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A <strong><i>HOT</i></strong>\u00a0New Take On Merge Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the casual, yet frustratingly fun experience of 'suika-likes' but want to taste something new? Whether it's a challenge or a casual cozy vibe you're looking for,\u00a0This silly  frying pan game has all the physics-based, merge goodness you'll love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624430/extras/b23473553efb9d2f6eacfe889ed3f5b8.poster.avif?t=1746724425\" width=480 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624430/extras/b23473553efb9d2f6eacfe889ed3f5b8.webm?t=1746724425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything and more! Hungry yet?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge bigger and bigger foods, chain sizzling combos for\u00a0a\u00a0higher score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace! Easy to pick up, difficult to beat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes if you want to turn up the heat or if you just want to keep it casual!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cosmetics via the Steam Market/Inventory</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match, Merge and Make Mayhem in a Pan!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss ingredients into your pan - flip, smoosh and bounce them to merge bigger and bigger surprises! Cook up even higher scores by merging bigger ingredients and chaining sizzling combos!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From cozy to challenging, Play it your way!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever you're tired of the classic 'suika-game' experience and chilling with your critters, Crank up the difficulty with different game modes and modifiers that are guaranteed to sizzle up a new challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More information to come! Please stay tuned as I update the Steam page and Demo :)</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i> </i></h2>",
    "short_description": "Cozy up by the campfire and merge ingredients in a sizzling pan to cook tastier creations! This silly physics-based merge game is easy to play, difficult to beat - Can you merge your way to the ultimate campfire feast?",
